{"unit_id":"roymina__dsh-cad#card-zh","repo":"roymina/dsh-cad","commit":"df6860b0a3044a14e71522cd6c90bca87c2aeff4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cad-plugin 是一个适用于 DSH 的 CAD 图纸处理插件，通过注册三个工具接收 DWG 和 DXF 文件路径。cad_inspect 可查看图纸元数据、单位、边界、图层、块和实体统计；cad_extract 可筛选并提取文本、图层、块或实体，还可保存 JSON/CSV 报告；cad_export 可生成 SVG/PNG 预览或转换为 DXF。适合需要在 DSH 会话中检查、整理或预览 CAD 图纸的用户。需要 Node.js 20 以上版本，不需要额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1040-1060"]}
{"unit_id":"roymina__dsh-cad#card-en","repo":"roymina/dsh-cad","commit":"df6860b0a3044a14e71522cd6c90bca87c2aeff4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cad-plugin provides three DSH tools for CAD files: inspect DWG/DXF metadata, extract drawing texts or entities to JSON/CSV, and export SVG/PNG previews or convert to DXF. It requires Node.js 20 or later and needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1040-1060"]}
