{"unit_id":"roymina__dsh-cad#feature-1","repo":"roymina/dsh-cad","commit":"df6860b0a3044a14e71522cd6c90bca87c2aeff4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cad-plugin 的功能「检查图纸」：读取 DWG 或 DXF 并返回元数据、单位、边界、图层、块和实体统计。通过 cad_inspect 工具传入文件路径，结果以 JSON 返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1042-1044"]}
{"unit_id":"roymina__dsh-cad#feature-2","repo":"roymina/dsh-cad","commit":"df6860b0a3044a14e71522cd6c90bca87c2aeff4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cad-plugin 的功能「提取图纸信息」：从 DWG/DXF 提取文本、图层、块或实体，可按图层、类型、搜索词等条件筛选，并选择保存 JSON 或 CSV 报告。使用 cad_extract 并提供路径和 section。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1047-1055"]}
{"unit_id":"roymina__dsh-cad#feature-3","repo":"roymina/dsh-cad","commit":"df6860b0a3044a14e71522cd6c90bca87c2aeff4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cad-plugin 的功能「预览与转换」：将 DWG/DXF 导出为 SVG、PNG 预览，或转换为 DXF。使用 cad_export 指定路径和格式，并可选择图层、布局、尺寸及背景。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1057-1060"]}
